description	"Officer Sylar

^2Weaponry:
- Stun Baton (2)
- Imperial Pistol (2)
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (3)
- Nuke Launcher (1)

^8Attributes:
- Heal (1)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]

While studying at the Imperial Academy Sylar Oranx became an officer in half the time it normally would take. Jealous at his academic achievements his superior officer moved Sylar to the prison world, where he would stay until called apon."